# MyEnv Clink Readline Configuration
# Map Ctrl+Space and Alt+H to win-history-list (The F7 Boxed History Menu: ┌──── History ────┐)

# 1. Ctrl+Space & Alt+H bound to win-history-list (Exact F7 History Menu)
"\C-@": win-history-list
"C-@": win-history-list
"\C- ": win-history-list
"C-Space": win-history-list
"Control-space": win-history-list
"Control-@": win-history-list
"\e[32;5u": win-history-list
"\eh": win-history-list

# 2. F7 key
"F7": win-history-list
"\e[18~": win-history-list

# 3. Tab Key -> File, Directory & Path Completion Menu
"\t": clink-completion-popup
"Tab": clink-completion-popup

# 4. Standard Text Editing & Cursor Movement (Left and Right arrows move character-by-character natively)
